### Cadastrar um animal
POST http://localhost:3333/animals
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "tag": "BR-001",
  "sex": "MALE",
  "category": "CALF",
  "breed": "Nelore",
  "birthPrecision": "MONTH_YEAR",
  "birthDate": "2024-03-01",
  "notes": "Primeiro animal cadastrado"
}

### Cadastrar um segundo animal (pra testar filtro)
POST http://localhost:3333/animals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tag": "BR-002",
  "sex": "FEMALE",
  "category": "COW",
  "breed": "Nelore"
}

### Listar animais
GET http://localhost:3333/animals

### Mudar status (vender um animal)
PATCH http://localhost:3333/animals/9a825337-d149-4fa3-84e4-ad7d67a1355e/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SOLD"
}

### Editar dados de um animal
PUT http://localhost:3333/animals/9a825337-d149-4fa3-84e4-ad7d67a1355e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "breed": "Angus",
  "notes": "Raça corrigida"
}
### Registrar uma pesagem
POST http://localhost:3333/animals/9a825337-d149-4fa3-84e4-ad7d67a1355e/pesagens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-06-01",
  "weightKg": 180.5
}

### Segunda pesagem (mais tarde, mais pesado)
POST http://localhost:3333/animals/9a825337-d149-4fa3-84e4-ad7d67a1355e/pesagens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-09-01",
  "weightKg": 240
}

### Terceira pesagem
POST http://localhost:3333/animals/9a825337-d149-4fa3-84e4-ad7d67a1355e/pesagens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-12-01",
  "weightKg": 300
}